Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Arrow, who are we\Nadding to our ranks today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's the lucky soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy there will be the sixth\Nnew stand user I've created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem real, but I've\Nconscripted a formidable crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And using their might, I'll eliminate any\Nmiscreant who comes after my Yoshikage!
