Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.17,0:02:01.85,Part 4 OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H95B630&}Living in this town surrounded by courage
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.85,0:02:06.06,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H9E69F8&}Great Days
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.81,0:02:13.11,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 27: {\fs80} I Am an Alien
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.81,0:02:13.11,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 27: {\fs80} I Am a Space Alien
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.02,0:02:13.48,Main,SPW,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's all the information we've managed to retrieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every piece of intel we could\Nfind on him is in that envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to the bastard who's done\Na damn fine job of covering his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your new name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whose face have you stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way I hear it, this is\Ntourist season in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he'll be able to\Nresist his urges for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch will be\Nitching to kill real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summertime has finally arrived!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.85,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}The summer season is finally upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you hadn't noticed,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.85,0:02:48.35,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}On July 1st, the beaches and rivers of Morioh \Nonce again opened to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,July 1st was the opening of Morioh's\Nbeautiful rivers and beaches.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.68,0:02:54.32,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}The hordes of incoming tourists coming from the capital\N and S city are making the town livelier than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With tourists descending on\Nus from S-City and beyond,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our little old Morioh is really hopping.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.32,0:02:58.32,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Relaxing at a summer villa, camping, fishing, yachting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you're getting\Na little R &R, camping,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishing, or yachting, consider\NMorioh your special summer paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.32,0:03:02.53,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's no end to the fun times to be had at this time of year!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.53,0:03:06.20,Narrator,Radi,0,0,0,,{\an8}How do you lovely people plan to enjoy this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how's everyone going to\Nmake the most of this season?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite the summer paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not just for the morally upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone wanted to enjoy the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all forced to live out our lives\Nconcealing our deepest hopes and fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to forever keep them to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can one truly live out their days\Nbehind such a veil of secrecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is for that girl to\Nsee the true Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.56,0:03:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hear the passion that burns within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To feel my hands wrapped around her tender\Nneck as I Ring the life from her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As my nails grow, so do my carnal desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to persevere\Nuntil the urge subsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I should practice this signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't mastered it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.42,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Kawajiri Kosaku
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.42,0:04:07.43,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Kosaku
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotorel Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the reason I'm\Nin this predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So dear, what are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have just used my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might enjoy a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I don't normally\Ndo this type of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought I'd try something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want any, that's fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, would you look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should hit the sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear your heart to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show her your true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baring my soul was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll figure me out at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he trying to unbutton\Nmy dress just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He apologized for scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, baby, you have\Nnothing to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new you is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know where it's coming\Nfrom, but it's turning me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd say this, but I\Nthink I've fallen in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the weird assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now am I going crazy or is that\None of those creepy slop hurdles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a crop circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's one of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought one of them would\Npop up in some random field in Morioh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a weird feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the\Nmiddle of the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's definitely not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're actually doing this I don't want\Nto we don't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be careful okay yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he alive or what well it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something scratched him\Non the back of his neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from what I can tell, he just fainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right? Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't think I've ever\Nseen this guy around at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally starting to come to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of an\Nempty field in Budogaoka Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, is this Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not certain why, but I\Nfelt quite unwell last evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have fallen unconscious\Nshortly thereafter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's past 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that fact, I estimate I've been\Nunconscious for nearly 13 Earth hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good one man\Nyou really had us going
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there i gotta hand it\Nto you that's one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best jokes i've heard\Nin a long time if this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole alien thing doesn't\Nwork out you can totally
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,become A comedian you're\Nhilarious you made your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own drop circle and\Nwaited in a bunch of weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for Someone to come by\Ntalk about committed to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bit brave, sir! Bravo! My stomach\Nhurts. I-I can't breathe? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.79,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Stomach medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freaking ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what school do you go to, Mr. Alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just not trying to die, my man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My home planet was in the Magellanic\NClouds, but it was recently destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've journeyed to Earth\Nto survey its livability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moreover, I seek to assess\Nthe amiability of its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of advice, you should quit\Nwhile you're ahead. You totally
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nailed the prank just ride the\Nwave and here have a tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many thanks that was\Nquite palatable hey look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the time we don't want\Nto be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah you're right let's head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see the way the guy\Nscarfed down that tissue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even comedians know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ice cream store's closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the only thing that\Nmakes Monday morning's parable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do\Nabout it now, so let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you two care for some ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you like the cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, but the place is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're shit out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is no reason to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just so happen to have two here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a quid pro quo for\Nthe tissues you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth seems quite livable\Nindeed. That it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you have ice cream cones\Nin your bag and how are they cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the ice of creams unsatisfactory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the point right now, alien boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall, I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you want me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may hereafter address\Nme as Nu Mikitaka Nushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lived 216 cycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the sole pilot of a spaceship and\NI also rather enjoy owning house pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the house mouse that\Nspends its days in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He particularly likes it\Nwhen I brush his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This freaks a stand\Nuser, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's send him to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your brain, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a\Nstand user would make up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a story about being from\Nthe Magellanic clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're so smart,\Nwhat the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the foggiest idea,\Nbut it's time to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat that ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're 216 years old? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're some kind of spaceship pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, why are you copying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's focus here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, friend, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling us you're an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An alien, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have informed you when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am indeed an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're a loony mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you had a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a genuine flying saucer, it\Nshould be no problem to call it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's currently at an\Naltitude of 1,500,000 kilometers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it'd take approximately three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you'll have to wait for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you call it with that watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive deductive reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, this must stay between we three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't share my secret with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that stunt with a crop\Ncircle was an innocent prank,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's off his rocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should knock this nose-ringed\Npsycho back to the mothership.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always let your fists do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dig a little deeper\Nbefore we get violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're an alien, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're hiding some kind of\Nray gun or anti-gravity device in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have both of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I did not journey to\NEarth to engage in conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I have stored them on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on, Mr. Alien Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show us\Nsomething cool already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even your blood is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What alien doesn't come with green blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alien blood's always green.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.30,0:12:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you accusing me of lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're calling you out, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can deal with a prank here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll be damned before I waste\Nmy time with a freak like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going\Nto do things my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always better to say it like it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did a fire break out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,W-what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to find a way to stop this sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a horrible sensation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic to this wretched noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get as far away\Nfrom him as we possibly can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just up and abandon\Nhim in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it was allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he can be such a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you doing okay over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me away from this horrid sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you were telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the ability to transmute\Nmy form into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let us take our leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, this sound is\Ngoing to split my head in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn into sneakers, so\Nplease put them on and save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In return for your help,\NI'll do anything you ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is some crazy speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because of your assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My speed and jumping abilities have\Nbeen doubled due to our combined power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just my luck!
