Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.92,0:15:01.96,Eyecatch - Episode 15,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be4\pos(100,790)}Hazekura Mikitaka
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you really can't see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then where did his powers come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a stubborn one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I've been trying to\Ntell you, I am an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, no offense, but it's hard\Nto wrap my head around all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I truly appreciate your saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sirens are mundane here, but the\Npeople on my planet abhor the sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wavelength is very upsetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to repay that kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the least I can do for one so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I turn into a fan for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a backscratcher to\Ngrab those hard-to-reach places?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get you out of there\Nbecause I wanted something in return!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you'll really do anything,\Nwell, who am I to turn you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you request of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, can you really\Nturn into anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like big or small or even multiples?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can transform into nearly anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, becoming complex machinery\Nor powerful objects is unfeasible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read you loud and clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can tell that we're going\Nto be the best of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to thank me, right? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in luck, because I just\Ncooked up a brilliant idea, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it's a win-win for\Neveryone. Win-win? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, a few weeks ago, I won quite a bit\Nof spending money in the local lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom found out about it, made a\Nbig stink, and froze my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that woman makes up her mind\Nabout something, your fate is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being flat broke during the summer\Nis the worst, let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I need you to turn into these!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pair of dice, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna make some cash with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I'll split the winnings\Nwith you, thus creating a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how do the dice function? Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you really don't know what dice are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's super easy to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who likes playing games\Ngoes nuts over these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got six sides and are\Nmade from a hard material.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The red dot represents\Nthe number one and the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other faces have different\Nnumbers up to six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's starting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The five dots represent\Nthe number five, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And three dots represent a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now try turning into one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's close, but you're a little\Ntoo big to pass for a real die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've also got an extra five.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each face has a different\Nnumber from one to six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The numbers on one side, and\Nits opposite should equal seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tickles something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock off the laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And dice aren't supposed to talk. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little nervous about this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look good. Make that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting all fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready to lose\Nsome cashola, Rohan Kishibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why would Josuke\NHigashikata be visiting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is certainly out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you uncover any more dirt on Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, nothing since the last\Ntime we checked in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all done with your\Nmanga work for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you'd let me take\Na peek at the next volume early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of nonsense are you scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.42,0:19:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't get anything past you, Mr. Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an ulterior motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please play Soul with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it? Soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be completely honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summer's finally here, and\NI'm totally strapped for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do have $30,000 on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all the money I've got\Nto my name, but it won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30,000 yen won't get\Nyou more than a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,visits to the amusement\Npark and some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I either make some\Ndough or go flat broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking risks and thrill-seeking is\Nthe very foundation of being young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I think at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've despised you from\Nthe moment I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no\Nreason for me to waste
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my precious time playing Soul with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're not\Nexactly hurting for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to play a game with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, count me in. Huh?\NSeriously? You'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't dislike games.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come around back whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have a great time, Mr. Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do these rules work for you?
