Dialogue: 3,0:20:19.36,0:20:22.70,Episode 27 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1110.857,1003.144)}The larger \Nnumber wins \N(Here, the six)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks good. Each chip\Nis worth a thousand yen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you must roll three dice into the\Nbowl if one falls out you lose Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll place the rules here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're in plain view.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be using those dice. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll use these.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a set I found in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some reason that you\Ndon't want to use my dice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really I feel inclined to play with my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own is all just a whim\Nwhen I mentioned I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intrigued it wasn't by the prospect\Nof playing Soul no no Josuke I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intrigued by the prospect of swiping\N30,000 yen from you now when you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Against me I expect you to pay in full I\Ndon't care how much we've been through!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dice he found are actually the alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to sneak them into his\Nhouse when he wasn't paying attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be a lot, but you're about\Nto fund my summer Fugo, Rohan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we determine\Nwho gets to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're up first. Roll the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I banged my hand into the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Place your bet and roll\Nthe dice. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, guess I'll start things\Noff by betting 2,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll throw down two chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I roll a one, a two, and a\Nthree, I'll have to pay double.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I need to avoid those\Nnumbers at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and two and three, keep\Nthose rolls away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first roll calls for a light\Ntouch, sort of like a practice toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an omen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Triple sixes, aka an omen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke wins five times what he wagered!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't start that way, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say was...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I had such dumb luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A triple six and five times the winnings?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.08,0:22:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the untrained eye, it almost looks\Nlike I'm cheating even though I'm not!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:54.60,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hmph. That was a quick ten-thousand yen \Nin spending money you earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, you already managed\Nto win 10,000 yen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get back what\NI've lost, so I think...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.23,0:23:02.27,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}I would like to earn back what I just lost, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wager 10 chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.16,0:23:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one, a two, and a three.
