Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.66,0:23:17.16,Episode 27 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz359\pos(936,853)}This will result in paying double
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan must pay double\Nthe amount of his wager.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.16,0:23:21.04,Thoughts,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is too much! This is way too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.24,0:23:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taken the hustle way too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.30,0:23:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.86,0:23:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this alien know the\Nmeaning of the word restraint?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.04,0:23:24.67,Thoughts,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Does this alien know the meaning of holding back?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.04,0:23:24.67,Thoughts,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Does this space alien know the meaning of holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, he'll bust us for sure.
